ce makes it hotter.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/182607119410665304/comments/default/7089222519548528555'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/182607119410665304/comments/default/7089222519548528555'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/10/rising-to-empire-falling-from-grace.html?showComment=1320872608142#c7089222519548528555' title=''/><author><name>Col. B. Bunny</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09590364016079745156</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://photos1.blogger.com/blogger2/5287/1302/200/Descartes.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/10/rising-to-empire-falling-from-grace.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-182607119410665304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/182607119410665304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-61133913"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 9, 2011 at 2:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4328557453895289243</id><published>2011-11-09T13:03:40.566-07:00</published><updated>2011-11-09T13:03:40.566-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Sorry, Colonel, but the &amp;quot;fools&amp;quot; have no ...</title><content type='html'>Sorry, Colonel, but the &amp;quot;fools&amp;quot; have no business solving ANY problems outside of the CONUS.  And while fundamentalist nuts exist in both Christendom, Islam, Hinduism etc. etc.  Adding fuel to the fire is no excuse.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/182607119410665304/comments/default/4328557453895289243'/><link rel='self' type='application/ato